== Effects ==
* +5 {{e|Bomb}}s.
* Bombs stick to enemies.
* Spawns 2-5 [[Blue Spider]]s when one of Isaac's bombs kills an enemy.
* {{dlc|r+}} Spawns 1-2 [[Blue Spider]]s or [[Blue Flies]] when it damages an enemy.
* {{dlc|r}} Bombs leave a puddle of [[slow]]ing white [[creep]] on the ground when they explode.
* {{dlc+|r}}{{transformation contribution|Spider Baby}}{{dlc-}}

== Notes ==
* Sticky Bombs spawn the same amount of spiders even if multiple enemies are killed with a single bomb.
* Sticky Bombs can stick to [[Status Effects#Effects|friendly]] enemies.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Bob's Rotten Head|anr}}: sticks to an enemy, the explosion is delayed but will deal 110 damage.
** {{dlc|r}} No longer sticks to enemies.
* {{i|Bomber Boy|r}}: Greatly increases the size of the creep puddle.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Dr. Fetus}}: Dr. Fetus bombs retain the sticky effect ({{dlc|nr}} unless Isaac has [[piercing]]). Dr. Fetus bombs will not spawn spiders even if they stick to an enemy.
** {{dlc|r}} The bombs always spawn slowing white creep after exploding.
* {{i|Mr. Mega|r}} / {{t|Lost Cork}}: No effect on the creep puddle size.

